se</a><a class="nav-link" href="/en/use-cases" aria-current="page">Use cases</a><a class="nav-link" href="/en/plans">Plans</a><a class="nav-link" href="/en/faq">FAQ</a><a class="nav-link" href="/en/blog/">Blog</a></div><a class="nav-cta" href="/en/plans">Discover Rumman</a></div><div class="nav-controls"><button class="theme-toggle" type="button" data-theme-toggle data-label-light="Use light theme" data-label-dark="Use dark theme" aria-label="Use dark theme" title="Use dark theme"><span aria-hidden="true">☾</span></button><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" data-menu-toggle aria-controls="primary-navigation" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button></div></nav></header><main id="conteudo"><section class="page-hero marketing-hero"><div class="wrap page-hero-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Use cases</p><h1>Workflows for small operations ready to leave improvisation behind.</h1><p class="hero-lead">Rumman is designed first for service companies, distributed inventory, rentals and mobile teams.</p></div><div class="page-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/assets/illustration-insights.svg" width="240" height="180" alt="" loading="lazy"></div></div></section><section class="section use-cases-section"><div class="wrap use-case-grid"><article class="use-case"><span class="feature-code">01</span><h2>Maintenance, installation and technical support</h2><dl><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Approved quotes get lost among messages, materials and collections.</dd><dt>Rumman flow</dt><dd>Customer → quote → work order → parts reservation → picking → execution → receivable.</dd><dt>Practical result</dt><dd>The team works with the same context and sees what still needs to start, be delivered or collected.</dd></dl></article><article class="use-case"><span class="feature-code">02</span><h2>Retail with more than one location</h2><dl><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Total stock exists, but no one knows which store, warehouse or vehicle holds the item.</dd><dt>Rumman flow</dt><dd>Balance by location → internal transfer → physical count → physical stock minus reservations.</dd><dt>Practical result</dt><dd>The company moves items without creating false inbound and outbound records in consolidated stock.</dd></dl></article><article class="use-case"><span class="feature-code">03</span><h2>Decorators, rental companies and events</h2><dl><dt>Problem</dt><dd>The same item may be promised for two dates and return without inspection.</dd><dt>Rumman flow</dt><dd>Reservation by period → location → pickup or delivery → return → payment.</dd><dt>Practical result</dt><dd>The schedule prevents conflicts and the return remains connected to the rental financial history.</dd></dl></article><article class="use-case"><span class="feature-code">04</span><h2>Warehouses and mobile teams</h2><dl><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Materials leave for vehicles and services without a simple trail.</dd><dt>Rumman flow</dt><dd>Warehouse → transfer to vehicle → work-order picking → dispatch confirmation → physical count.</dd><dt>Practical result</dt><dd>Each location keeps its own balance, and consumption is posted only after confirmation.</dd></dl></article></div></section><section class="section boundary-section"><div class="wrap split-intro"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Clear limits</p><h2>Operational management without fiscal or banking promises the product does not make.</h2></div><div class="section-copy"><p>Rumman does not advertise invoice issuance, tax accounting, Open Finance, real-time banking, operational WhatsApp, unlimited storage or AI deciding alone.</p><p>Reports and guidance support management but do not replace an accountant, lawyer, financial adviser or other qualified professional.</p></div></div></section><section class="final-cta"><div class="wrap final-cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Rumman · Guided Intelligent ERP</p><h2>Clearer management for work with less friction.</h2><p>Organize customers, cash flow, documents and everyday decisions in a guided Android experience.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/en/features">Discover features</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap footer-main"><div class="footer-brand-block"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="/en/"><span class="brand-icon"><img src="/assets/icon-192.png" width="192" height="192" alt=""></span><span class="brand-name">Rumman</span></a><p>Guided intelligent Android ERP for small businesses.</p><a class="footer-contact" href="mailto:e-mail@rumman.app.br">Contact Rumman: e-mail@rumman.app.br</a><nav class="language-switcher footer-language" aria-label="Language"><span class="visually-hidden">Language</span><a href="/casos-de-uso" lang="pt-BR">PT</a><a href="/en/use-cases" lang="en" aria-current="page">EN</a><a href="/es/casos-de-uso" lang="es">ES</a><a href="/fr/cas-usage" lang="fr">FR</a></nav></div><div class="footer-links"><strong>Product</strong><a href="/en/features">Features</a><a href="/en/how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="/en/how-to-use">How to use</a><a href="/en/use-cases" aria-current="page">Use cases</a><a href="/en/plans">Plans</a><a href="/en/faq">FAQ</a></div><div class="footer-links"><strong>Content</strong><a href="/en/blog/">Blog</a><a href="/en/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/en/terms">Terms of Use</a><a href="/en/delete-account">Delete account</a><a href="/en/support">Support</a></div></div><div class="wrap footer-bottom"><span class="footer-made">© 2026 Rumman · Made with care in Brazil<img class="footer-flag" src="/assets/flag-br.svg" width="22" height="16" alt=""></span><span>Developed by <a href="https://pascoal.eti.br" rel="external noopener">pascoal.eti.br</a></span></div></footer><script src="/assets/site.js?v=20260728-1" defer></script></body></html>